## Key Decisions
- **bankStatement → WrittenVOE is correct, not a bug.** OB v4 channel 165481
  only accepts 5 enum values for incomeVerificationType (probed empirically,
  every other value HTTP 400). WrittenVOE is the only legal value for
  alt-doc scenarios on this channel.
- **All three doc flags hardcoded to 'Verified'** regardless of broker
  doc-type selection (per user instruction). noRatio → 'None' edge case
  removed.
- **Reason field is `ineligibleReason` (SINGULAR)** on the /ineligible
  endpoint, but `notEligibleReasons` (plural) on inline notEligibleProducts.
  Parser now checks both; this was the root cause of empty reasons[]
  before commit 4c57568.
- **Disqualified-programs card visible to ALL brokers**, not admin-gated.
  Broker self-diagnoses LTV/FICO/state issues without emailing tposupport.
- **cleanAdjustmentReason() applied to ineligible reasons** — same cleanup
  helper used for LLPA reasons. Strips "Max of LTV/CLTV/HCLTV is " prefix,
  converts ", And " connectors to commas.

